;; fixture — beancount-close eval9 (statement covers only part of the close period)
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking USD
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Food:Groceries USD
2026-01-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances

2026-05-31 * "Opening balance"
  Assets:Bank:Checking      1000.00 USD
  Equity:Opening-Balances

2026-06-01 balance Assets:Bank:Checking   1000.00 USD

2026-06-10 * "WHOLE FOODS"
  Assets:Bank:Checking       -50.00 USD
  Expenses:Food:Groceries

2026-06-25 * "MARKET DELI"
  Assets:Bank:Checking       -20.00 USD
  Expenses:Food:Groceries
